L197: Although text-to-image generation models have higher realism, the flickering issues still bother, since the generated frames are not coherent if the method applies the text-to-image model frame by frame, conditioning on the synthetic videos. The results, shown in Table cite111†3 , also indicate that our method is highly competitive with WAN2.1 VACE.
